      "level": "A1",
      "title": "El verbo to be",
      "subtitle": "Ser y estar en una sola palabra",
      "grammar": [
        "**To be** significa ser y estar: **I am**, **you are**, **he/she/it is**, **we are**, **they are**.",
        "Contracciones habituales: I'm, you're, she's, we're. Negativo: **I'm not**, **she isn't**. Pregunta: **Are you tired?**"
      ],
